{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 1, :comments ["<b>ויכלו.</b> From where do we know that we say it standing? Because it is testimony to the Holy One, blessed be He, that He created His world in six days, and testimony is from standing, as it is written: ״ועמדו ב' האנשים״. And it is found in the chapter כל כתבי: at the time a person says ויכלו, two angels who accompany the person place their hands on his head and say to him: ״וסר עונך וחטאתך תכופר״. And if you ask: what is different about this verse? The answer: because it is written regarding testimony, ״אם לא יגיד ונשא עונו״, and this one who says ויכלו did not withhold his testimony but gave it."], :book :genesis, :voice :daat-zkenim, :lang :en, :chapter 2, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T13:05:00.155723457Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}